        "operationId": "ListAssetResource",
        "consumes": [
          "application/json"
        ],
        "produces": [
          "application/json;charset=utf-8"
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "X-Auth-Token",
            "in": "header",
            "description": "**参数解释**:\n用户Token。\nToken认证就是在调用API的时候将Token加到请求消息头,从而通过身份认证,获得操作API的权限,[获取Token](ai4sservice_03_0011.xml)接口响应消息头中X-Subject-Token的值即为Token。\n**约束限制**:\n不涉及\n**取值范围**:\n长度为[1-32768]个字符。\n**默认取值**:\n不涉及",
            "required": true,
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 32768
          },
          {
            "name": "project_id",
            "in": "path",
            "description": "**参数解释**:\n项目ID,您可以从[获取项目ID](ai4sservice_03_0033.xml)中获取。\n**约束限制**:\n不涉及\n**取值范围**:\n仅支持字母、数字、中划线和下划线,长度为[1-128]个字符。\n**默认取值**:\n不涉及",
            "required": true,
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 128,
            "pattern": "^[a-zA-Z0-9_-]*$",
            "x-pattern-message": "project_id is invalid"
          },
          {
            "name": "spec_code",
            "in": "query",
            "type": "string",
            "description": "**参数解释**:\n规格编码。\n**约束限制**:\n不涉及\n**取值范围**:\n长度为[1-64]个字符。\n**默认取值**:\n不涉及",
            "required": false,
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 64
          },
          {
            "name": "status_list",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "description": "**参数解释**:\n资产的订购状态。\n**约束限制**:\n数组数量范围[0-10],数组元素仅支持Normal|Freeze|Deleted。\n**取值范围**:\n不涉及\n**默认取值**:\n不涉及",
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string",
              "x-enum-type": "AssetResourceStatusEnum"
            },
            "minItems": 0,
            "maxItems": 10
          },
          {
            "name": "limit",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "**参数解释**:\n限制量,单次查询总量。\n**约束限制**:\n不涉及\n**取值范围**:\n1-1000\n**默认取值**:\n100",
            "required": false,
            "type": "integer",
            "format": "int32",
            "default": 100,
            "maximum": 1000,
            "minimum": 1
          },
          {
            "name": "offset",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "**参数解释**:\n偏移量,查询起始偏移。\n**约束限制**:\n不涉及\n**取值范围**:\n0-100000000\n**默认取值**:\n0",
            "required": false,
            "type": "integer",
            "format": "int32",
            "default": 0,
            "maximum": 100000000,
            "minimum": 0
          }
        ],
        "x-request-examples-description-1": "查询计费资产资源列表。",
        "x-request-examples-url-1": "https://{endpoint}/v1/{project_id}/assets/assets-resources",
        "responses": {
